{"id":"wb-4-202","name":"瞿秋白故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"瞿秋白故居","text":"瞿秋白故居是中国共产党早期领导人之一的瞿秋白的故居，于1996年11月被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。现已被扩建后的瞿秋白同志纪念馆融为一体，是江苏省的爱国主义教育基地之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9E%BF%E7%A7%8B%E7%99%BD%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":92131653,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92131653","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d3ed694ac34ed5c0afafe0f5.jpg","title":"Former Residence of Qu Qiubai 02 2012-04.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Former_Residence_of_Qu_Qiubai_02_2012-04.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/Former_Residence_of_Qu_Qiubai_02_2012-04.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​瞿秋白故居之瞿氏宗祠，自东南侧看。","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Former Residence of Qu Qiubai","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Former_Residence_of_Qu_Qiubai"}}